        "liquid_W8Yj3p": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "liquid": "<div class=\"drainelle-benefits\">\n  <div class=\"benefits-list\">\n    <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n      <span class=\"benefit-icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n          <path d=\"M12 2c-3.5 5-7 9-7 13a7 7 0 0 0 14 0c0-4-3.5-8-7-13z\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </span>\n      <p class=\"benefit-text\">\n        <strong>Un corps qui respire enfin</strong> — sensation de légèreté dès la 1ère semaine\n      </p>\n    </div>\n \n    <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n      <span class=\"benefit-icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n          <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" r=\"2.2\"/>\n          <path d=\"M12 7.5v5M9 10h6M9 12.5l-1.5 8M15 12.5l1.5 8\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </span>\n      <p class=\"benefit-text\">\n        <strong>Jambes légères, ventre apaisé</strong> — moins de gonflements au quotidien\n      </p>\n    </div>\n \n    <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n      <span class=\"benefit-icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n          <path d=\"M20 4c-9 0-16 5-16 14 9 0 16-5 16-14z\"/>\n          <path d=\"M5 18c3-5 7-8 14-10\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </span>\n      <p class=\"benefit-text\">\n        <strong>100% naturel, pensé pour toi</strong> — aucun stimulant, aucune substance agressive\n      </p>\n    </div>\n \n    <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n      <span class=\"benefit-icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n          <path d=\"M20 14.5A8 8 0 1 1 9.5 4a6.5 6.5 0 0 0 10.5 10.5z\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </span>\n      <p class=\"benefit-text\">\n        <strong>Des matins plus doux</strong> — un corps qui se sent moins raide, plus fluide\n      </p>\n    </div>\n \n    <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n      <span class=\"benefit-icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n          <path d=\"M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4M6 6l2.5 2.5M15.5 15.5L18 18M18 6l-2.5 2.5M8.5 15.5L6 18\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </span>\n      <p class=\"benefit-text\">\n        <strong>L'esprit plus clair, le cœur plus léger</strong> — sérénité retrouvée au quotidien\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n \n<style>\n  .drainelle-benefits {\n    max-width: 620px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .benefits-list {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .benefit-item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .benefit-icon {\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    color: #1B3B2F;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n  .benefit-icon svg {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n  }\n  .benefit-text {\n    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: #3A4A40;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .benefit-text strong {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #12261C;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 749px) {\n    .benefit-text {\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>"
          }
        },
